; SMB audit: recursive walk keeping parents open (old PS1:, fixed PS9:), then List after an idle reconnect
FailAt 21
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/dhcp ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START
Wait 6
Mount DH0:PrismNet/smb/PS1
Mount DH0:PrismNet/smb/PS9
Echo "start" >DH0:PrismNet/smbwalk.log
Echo "==== OLD handler walk (expect 80 files, 2 dirs)" >>DH0:PrismNet/smbwalk.log
DH0:PrismNet/walk PS1:pn-audit/A LIMIT=400 >>DH0:PrismNet/smbwalk.log
Echo "==== NEW handler walk" >>DH0:PrismNet/smbwalk.log
DH0:PrismNet/walk PS9:pn-audit/A LIMIT=400 >>DH0:PrismNet/smbwalk.log
Echo "==== NEW handler: List A ALL after the idle disconnect" >>DH0:PrismNet/smbwalk.log
Wait 130
List PS9:pn-audit/A ALL >>DH0:PrismNet/smbwalk.log
Echo "DONE" >>DH0:PrismNet/smbwalk.log
